{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116180","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116180/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116180/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116180/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116180","id":3928017877,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7qIMvV","number":116180,"title":"An exported variable of an inner class extending Resource is treated as a Resource","user":{"login":"JudeLingan","id":67759290,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NzU5Mjkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67759290?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JudeLingan","html_url":"https://github.com/JudeLingan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JudeLingan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JudeLingan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JudeLingan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JudeLingan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JudeLingan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JudeLingan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JudeLingan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JudeLingan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JudeLingan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-02-11T18:27:55Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T22:20:50Z","closed_at":"2026-02-11T20:16:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.4.0\n\n### System information\n\nArch Linux - Godot-4.6-stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nI discovered this first from a statically typed dictionary. When making a new key/value pair, when you try to make a new InnerClass in the dictionary from the inspector, it shows a popup with seemingly every resource type in Godot. The attached image shows what it looks like. I assume that the engine is interpreting InnerClass to mean Resource somehow.\n\nI tested later if it would work with a variable that was exported with type InnerClass, and that showed the same results. Because of this, I think the bug is in the code for exporting variables or inner classes, and not in the code for Dictionaries specifically. The attached image shows what the menu looks like. I have also tested if it would throw an error when you run a scene with a Resource attached to a variable with type InnerResource extending Resource, and it did not (which I would assume it should).\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/763bca99-c5db-417d-b3a7-1d7db408edb2\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDownload the minimal reproduction project and try to change the value of Inner in the inspector or add an element with a non-null value to the exported dictionary in the Node in test.tscn\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25241877/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"JudeLingan","id":67759290,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NzU5Mjkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67759290?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JudeLingan","html_url":